{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/heights-binghatti-developers-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":255,"crm_id":"622","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Heights","slug":"heights-binghatti-developers-jvc-jumeirah-village-circle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Circle (JVC)","building_type":["apartment"],"completion_year":"Ready ","developer":"Binghatti","price":1000000,"display_price":"1M","lattitude":25.0649856,"longitude":55.1992225,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Binghatti Heights - a luxury project by Binghatti, located in JVC. The development has a unique design that blends contemporary style with traditional Middle Eastern elements. The tower rises 30 residential floors above the city and offers luxurious <strong>1-3 bedroom apartments</strong> with picturesque views of the surrounding area.</p><p>The complex has 24-hour security with video surveillance. Also available to residents are a swimming pool, gym, children's playground and green spaces for recreation and recreational areas with walking paths. There are cafes and restaurants, schools and nurseries as well as shops and supermarkets within walking distance.</p><p>Heights is located in the central neighbourhood of JVC, close to Hessa Street and Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road. Circle Mall and Al Khail Avenue Mall are just 5 minutes away, Dubai Marina and Jumeirah Beach Residences are 12 minutes away and Downtown, Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall are approximately 15 minutes away.</p><p>Each Heights residence is designed to provide the ultimate in comfort and cosiness, while the complex's extensive infrastructure will make life here vibrant and busy.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazona